## Done when

- [ ] On every path, `summarize_game` runs once for each finished match (tests 1–3), and a retry reuses that fold.
- [ ] A parked fold holds back no other rated result (test 4).
- [ ] The existing tests in `tests/api/results.rs`, `game_records.rs`, `quests.rs`, `ranked.rs`, `rewards.rs` and `actor/glitch.rs` pass unchanged.
