## Goal

`record_result` reads a finished match's row and log in a short transaction of its own and folds the log once, off the runtime and outside every transaction. The quests in `write_once` and the game record both read that one fold, so `summarize_game` runs once per finished match, whatever its kind. A write retried on a duplicate reuses the fold, and a parked fold holds back no other match's result. What gets written does not change (rows, ratings, payouts, quest moves, log events), so this needs no ruling.

